<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8"/>
    <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
    <title>Agentic PM — O Curso para PMs que Querem Ficar Acima do Algoritmo</title>
    <link href="/favicon.png" rel="icon" type="image/png"/>
    
    <!-- Google Analytics (GA4) -->
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-9EG1G4L3VS"></script>
    <script>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
      gtag('js', new Date());
      gtag('config', 'G-9EG1G4L3VS');
    </script>

    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0D1117;
            --bg-card: #1A2332;
            --primary: #00E5CC;
            --secondary: #FF2D78;
            --accent: #FBBF24;
            --text: #E8E8E8;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
            --green: #10B981;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        header {
            padding: 30px 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .badge-community {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0D1117 0%, #1A0F2E 50%, #0D1117 100%);
            padding: 140px 0 100px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(0, 229, 204, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(255, 45, 120, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        
        .hero-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        
        .hero-text h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--white);
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        
        .hero-subheadline {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--secondary);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        
        .hero-text p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #B0B0B0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        
        .contrast-box {
            background: rgba(0, 229, 204, 0.08);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--white);
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        
        .contrast-box strong {
            color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .social-proof {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .proof-chip {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #B0B0B0;
            background: rgba(0, 229, 204, 0.05);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 204, 0.2);
        }
        
        .proof-chip strong {
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .lead-form {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        
        .lead-form h3 {
            color: var(--white);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .form-group input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: white;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        
        .form-button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 18px;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 800;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .form-button:hover {
            background: #00f5ff;
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 18px 36px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, #2DD4BF 100%);
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 229, 204, 0.2);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 229, 204, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-accent {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent) 0%, #F59E0B 100%);
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2);
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.7); }
            70% { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 0 0 15px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(251, 191, 36, 0); }
        }
        
        .pain-section {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 100px 0;
            color: #1A1A1A;
        }
        
        .pain-section h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .pain-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .pain-item {
            padding: 20px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary);
        }

        .pain-item h4 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .pain-highlight {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-top: 60px;
            font-style: italic;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .agitation-section {
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            padding: 100px 0;
        }
        
        .data-box {
            background: rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 204, 0.1);
            padding: 60px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .data-box h3 {
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }
        
        .data-point {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-left: 30px;
            position: relative;
            color: #B0B0B0;
        }
        
        .data-point::before {
            content: "◆";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .warning-box {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid var(--secondary);
            color: var(--secondary);
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .turnaround-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A0F2E 0%, #0D1117 100%);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 100px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .turnaround-section h2 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .turnaround-highlight {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 800;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        
        .modules-section {
            background: #f8f7ff;
            padding: 100px 0;
            color: var(--bg-dark);
        }

        .modules-section h2 {
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
        }

        .modules-section h2::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 0;
            width: 60px;
            height: 4px;
            background: #7c3aed;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .modules-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .module-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-left: 3px solid #7c3aed;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            color: #374151;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }

        .module-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-left-width: 5px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.15);
        }

        .module-label {
            color: #7c3aed;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: block;
        }

        .module-card h3 {
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .module-card strong {
            color: #7c3aed;
        }

        .diagnosis-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A0F2E 0%, #0D1117 100%);
            padding: 100px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .diagnosis-section h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--white);
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .diagnosis-section p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #B0B0B0;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .target-section {
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            padding: 100px 0;
        }
        
        .target-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
        }
        
        .target-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }
        
        .target-box h3 {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .target-list {
            list-style: none;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .target-list li {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #B0B0B0;
        }
        
        .target-list li::before {
            content: "✓";
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .target-box.not-for .target-list li::before {
            content: "✗";
            color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .instructor-section {
            padding: 100px 0;
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            background: #f8f7ff;
        }
        
        .instructor-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .instructor-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 380px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, #2DD4BF 100%);
            border-radius: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .instructor-image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        
        .instructor-text h2 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--bg-dark);
        }
        
        .instructor-text p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        
        .urgency-section {
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            padding: 100px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .date-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        #countdown {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .countdown-item {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .countdown-number {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--primary);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            min-width: 90px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 204, 0.2);
        }

        .countdown-label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: 8px;
            opacity: 0.6;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .price-comparison {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .urgency-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .urgency-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
        }

        .bonus-section {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            padding: 100px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .bonus-section h2 {
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .bonus-card {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            text-align: left;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .bonus-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .bonus-value {
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--secondary);
        }

        .offer-section {
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            padding: 120px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .offer-box {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 60px;
            border-radius: 32px;
            border: 2px solid var(--secondary);
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .price-tag {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .guarantee-section {
            background: #ecfdf5;
            color: #065f46;
            padding: 80px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .faq-section {
            background: var(--white);
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            padding: 100px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .faq-section h2 {
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .faq-section h2::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 0;
            width: 60px;
            height: 4px;
            background: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .faq-container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .faq-item {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }

        .faq-question {
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .faq-answer {
            display: none;
            padding-top: 15px;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .faq-item.active .faq-answer {
            display: block;
        }

        footer {
            padding: 50px 0;
            background: #050505;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            opacity: 0.6;
            text-align: center;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-content, .instructor-content, .target-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
            .hero-text h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .price-tag { font-size: 3rem; }
            #countdown { gap: 10px; }
            .countdown-number { min-width: 70px; font-size: 2rem; padding: 10px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <div class="logo">Product Maker</div>
            <div class="badge-community">✓ Recomendado por comunidades de PMs</div>
        </header>
    </div>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <div class="hero-text">
                    <span class="eyebrow">Agentic PM · Lançamento 2026</span>
                    <h1>Enquanto a IA devora o PM tradicional, você vira <strong>insubstituível</strong>.</h1>
                    <p class="hero-subheadline">Deixe de ser um executor de tarefas. Comece a orquestrar sistemas inteligentes. Ganhe 2-3x mais impacto (e valor de mercado).</p>
                    <p>O mercado de produto está se dividindo: de um lado, PMs que apenas operam ferramentas. Do outro, o <strong>Agentic PM</strong> — o profissional que desenha, governa e escala workflows autônomos.</p>
                    <div class="contrast-box">
                        O PM tradicional gasta 80% do tempo em execução mecânica. O <strong>Agentic PM</strong> usa 80% do tempo em estratégia, enquanto seus agents cuidam do resto.
                    </div>
                    <div class="social-proof">
                        <div class="proof-chip">✓ <strong>150+ alunos</strong></div>
                        <div class="proof-chip">✓ <strong>300k+</strong> profissionais alcançados</div>
                        <div class="proof-chip">✓ <strong>Garantia 30 dias</strong></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="lead-form">
                    <h3>Garanta seu acesso antecipado</h3>
                    <div class="_form_1"></div>
                    <script src="https://diasallana1990.activehosted.com/f/embed.php?id=1" charset="utf-8"></script>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pain-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Você reconhece essa sensação?</h2>
            <div class="pain-grid">
                <div class="pain-item">
                    <h4>O Medo da Substituição</h4>
                    <p>Você vê a IA fazendo PRDs, User Stories e análises em segundos e se pergunta: "O que sobra para mim?"</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pain-item">
                    <h4>O Síndrome do Executor</h4>
                    <p>Você passa o dia facilitando reuniões e gerenciando processos que parecem cada vez mais mecânicos.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pain-item">
                    <h4>A Estagnação Salarial</h4>
                    <p>O mercado está mudando e quem não domina a orquestração agêntica está começando a ganhar menos.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pain-highlight" style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bg-dark); line-height: 1.4;">
                "O paradoxo do PM atual: temos as ferramentas mais potentes da história, mas nunca nos sentimos tão ameaçados."
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="agitation-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="data-box">
                <h3>O mercado está se reorganizando. Agora.</h3>
                <div class="data-point">As vagas no Brasil que exigem conhecimento em IA quadruplicaram em três anos, saltando de 19 mil em 2021 para 73 mil em 2024, segundo a PwC.</div>
                <div class="data-point">Empresas já contratam "Orchestration PM" — um cargo que não existia 2 anos atrás.</div>
                <div class="data-point">A camada intermediária do PM tradicional está se comprimindo. Quem apenas gerencia processos está sendo absorvido.</div>
                <div class="warning-box">
                    AVISO: Você não será substituído amanhã. Mas será desmonetizado se continuar agindo como um executor.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="turnaround-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Mas existe outro caminho.</h2>
            <p>O PM que vai prosperar nos próximos anos não é o que usa IA mais rápido. É aquele que teve a coragem de redesenhar completamente o seu papel.</p>
            <p><strong>Ele parou de competir com a IA. Ele passou a comandá-la.</strong></p>
            <div class="turnaround-highlight">
                Esse é o Agentic PM. O PM que resta quando a IA engole tudo que era mecânico.
            </div>
            <p>Ele desenha workflows inteligentes, constrói ecossistemas de agents autônomos e cria produtos agênticos que funcionam com mínima intervenção humana.</p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 30px; color: var(--primary);">Quanto mais a IA avança, mais valioso ele se torna.</p>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="window.location.href='https://pay.kiwify.com.br/NSAhP7F'" style="margin-top: 40px;" onmouseover="trackCtaClick('Turnaround CTA')">QUERO ME TORNAR UM AGENTIC PM →</button>
